{
  "bodyHash": "09bdcbd7e76a7884",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Aquaculture 2 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>（1.14.4+）</em></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>僅適用於 NeoForge（僅限 1.20.4 之前的 Minecraft Forge</em>）</span></p>\n<p>Aquaculture 2 擴充了 Minecraft 的釣魚系統，新增超過 30 種新魚類可供捕獲，您可以使用魚竿（任何模組或原版魚竿皆可！）捕撈，或在野外直接發現它們在水中游動<span style=\"font-size:10px\">。</span>&nbsp;此外，本模組還新增了多種魚竿，讓您能夠裝備魚鉤與餌料以獲得額外功能。您還可以自訂釣魚線與浮標，讓您的魚竿獨一無二。所有修飾符與自訂道具均可在釣具盒中進行套用，該盒子也能用來儲存額外的魚鉤、餌料、釣線與浮標。<br>\n每個生態域類型（甚至包含模組新增的生態域）都有專屬的新魚種，能為您的釣魚體驗和世界增添色彩，魚群會在河流、池塘和海洋中游動！捕獲的魚可以加工成魚排，產量取決於魚的種類&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<em>（若啟用設定選項，則取決於魚的重量）。</em></span>&nbsp;此外，釣魚時還能獲得閃亮的新戰利品！（包括傳說中的 Neptunium 工具或盔甲！&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<em>（可設定）</em>)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多文件請參閱我們的維基。</em></a></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>可捕獲魚類</h3>\n<p>**淡水魚<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/smallmouth_bass.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;小口黑鱸<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bluegill.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;藍鰓太陽魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_trout.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;褐鱒<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/carp.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鯉魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/catfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鯰魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/gar.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;雀鱔<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/minnow.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;麥穗魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/muskellunge.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;白斑狗魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/perch.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;河鱸</p>\n<p>**乾旱區<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bayad.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;巴亞魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/boulti.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;布爾提魚（尼羅羅非魚）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/capitaine.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;卡皮坦魚（尼羅河鱸）<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/synodontis.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;辛諾多西斯鮎</p>\n<p><strong>北冰洋</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_cod.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋鱈魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/blackfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;黑魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pacific_halibut.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;太平洋大比目魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_halibut.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋大比目魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_herring.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋鯡魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pink_salmon.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;粉紅鮭魚 <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>（亦出沒於河流）<br></em></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pollock.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;綠青鱈<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/rainbow_trout.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;虹�磚<br></span></p>\n<p>**鹹水域<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/jellyfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;水母<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_grouper.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;紅石斑魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tuna.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鮪魚</p>\n<p>**叢林<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arapaima.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;巨骨舌魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arrau_turtle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;亞拉龜<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/piranha.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;食人魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tambaqui.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;紅腹巨脂鯉</p>\n<p>**沼澤<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/AQ2-1.18.2/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/frog.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;青蛙 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>（自 Minecraft 1.19 起移除）</em></span></span><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/leech.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;水蛭<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box_turtle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;箱龜<br>\n<em>& 淡水魚</em></p>\n<p><strong>蘑菇島</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_shrooma.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;紅色蘑菇魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_shrooma.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;棕色蘑菇魚<br>\n<em>& 淡水魚</em></p>\n<p>**其他戰利品<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/driftwood.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;漂流木<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tin_can.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;鐵罐<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/goldfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;小金魚<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/message_in_a_bottle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;瓶中訊息 [右鍵點擊顯示訊息！]<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/algae.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;藻類（淡水生態域）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;盒子<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/lockbox.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;鎖箱<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/treasure_chest.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;寶箱<br></span>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_5b8066e6-2213-4384-bd51-f1a9ebc43885.png\" alt=\"image\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;海神的賞賜</span></p>\n<h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_7cd9898d-34ac-41cf-bc0a-83f164936de2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_f4cea8f5-8a94-4faf-ac50-545b226ca22a.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_6bc91821-7595-4bd9-ad44-d74559bb46e4.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_ae62d924-8a4d-4e23-8b04-31f06095fde7.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_b8273603-600f-4de3-bc49-1668e832b3f8.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2>**截圖</h2>\n<p>**</p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WcjgaH5.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_010ee9bb-373a-4eae-95d2-dfc006a5ac32.png\" alt=\"image\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Pee4rVN.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Aquaculture 1&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:8px\">（1.12.2 及更早版本）</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><h2><strong>Aquaculture</strong></h2><h2><strong>簡介</strong></h2><p>Aquaculture 擴充了 Minecraft 原生的釣魚系統。它讓你能夠使用全新系列的釣竿與工具，捕獲超過 30 種新魚類。每個生物群系都有新種類的魚，且掉落重量隨機，可製成魚排與食物；此外還有釣魚時可獲得的閃亮新戰利品！（包含傳說中的海神金屬工具或盔甲！）<br>&nbsp;</p><p>要開始你的 Aquaculture 之旅，你需要製作鐵、金或鑽石釣竿（請見下方）。</p><h2><strong>The </strong>可釣魚類</h2><p><strong>淡水</strong>（森林、平原、高山）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 藍鰓太陽魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鱸魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鰈魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 褐鱒<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯰魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯉魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 狗魚</p><p><strong>乾旱</strong>（沙漠）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lDQoL0K.png\">&nbsp;尼羅河鱸魚 (Capitaine)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I26Avrc.png\">&nbsp;尼羅非鯽 (Boulti)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R5QHHFq.png\">&nbsp;鮠魚 (Bagrid)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dgwY14b.png\">&nbsp;反游貓魚 (Synodontis)</p><p><strong>寒帶</strong>（苔原、泰加林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鱈魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9s2ltlX.png\">&nbsp;牙鱈<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qVDga8e.png\">&nbsp;鯡魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrSz9ij.png\">&nbsp;大比目魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sCzdERo.png\">&nbsp;粉紅鮭魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 虹鱒<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AV269o8.png\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑魚</p><p><strong>海水</strong>（海灘、海洋）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鮭魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鮪魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 紅石斑魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 旗魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯊魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯨魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VoalDkJ.png\">&nbsp;魷魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QBYqKg0.png\">&nbsp;河豚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O7O4Yhn.png\">&nbsp;水母</p><p><strong>熱帶</strong>（叢林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VxAbR5Z.png\">&nbsp;巨骨舌魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZJfauHY.png\">&nbsp;食人魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZBq8t3r.png\">&nbsp;銀脂鯉<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1W9PXAS.png\"> 電鰻</p><p><strong>半鹹水&nbsp;</strong>（沼澤）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g0poZkE.png\">&nbsp;青蛙<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lBdrN6N.png\">&nbsp;烏龜<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tyWN6yW.png\">&nbsp;水蛭<br><em>以及淡水魚類</em></p><p><strong>蘑菇</strong>（蘑菇島）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 紅色菇魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 棕色菇魚<br><em>以及淡水魚類</em></p><p><strong>所有生物群系<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aCuEOwi.png\">&nbsp;金魚</p><p><strong>隨機戰利品<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b4g5G3X.png\">&nbsp;海藻（淡水生物群系）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mXcrvNX.png\">&nbsp;海帶（海水生物群系）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k55j8Ce.png\">&nbsp;木棍<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/muk8uoO.png\">漂流木 [可合成木板！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vHoSvD1.png\">&nbsp;皮革靴<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFfLBqW.png\">&nbsp;鐵罐<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8upC4TT.png\">&nbsp;骨骼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S2meWvo.png\">&nbsp;瓶中訊息 [右鍵點擊以顯示訊息！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/czINLcQ.png\">&nbsp;箱子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XdbpBOV.png\">&nbsp;鎖箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Rhw4Kb.png\">&nbsp;寶箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qp9VJRT.png\">&nbsp;海神金屬寶箱 (?!?)<br><br></p><p>注意：如果你使用了新增生物群系的模組，或在沒有特定魚類的生物群系中釣魚，系統將預設為淡水魚類。</p><h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rD02ZQ8.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1CPhaD.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/so1cDZT.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uNoAFwR.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a1PqJ01.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LmSyklA.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSw5Nk9.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dRYEhhO.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wXoxO0H.png\" width=\"456\" height=\"256\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tlqIbKH.png\"></p><h2><strong>附魔</strong></h2><p>誘惑 - 增加捕獲魚類數量<br>磁性 - 增加戰利品掉落<br>遠投 - 釣竿拋投距離更遠<br>近投 - 釣竿拋投距離較近<br>雙鉤 - 有機率一次釣到兩條魚<br>倒刺鉤 - 咬鉤後收線時間延長<br>重線 - 提高釣到大重量物品的機率</p><h2><strong>截圖</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"514\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" width=\"872\" height=\"520\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"504\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" width=\"892\" height=\"544\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qETDITO.png\"></p></div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-